            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FA34D" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 4px;">FEMA P-320 & ICC-500 Verified</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Every shelter model is impact-tested at the Texas Tech Wind Institute to withstand 250 mph EF5 winds.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FA34D" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Grayson County Rebate Assistance</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">We assist homeowners through the 50% county safe room grant application to save up to $3,000.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2FA34D" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 4px;">Turnkey Installation in 1 Day</p>
